  "bodyHash": "c96e2d7a8c7faa3b",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>所有功勞歸 MARCOSJOESTAR 所有</strong></h1>\n<h3>(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-immersive-tacz-integration</a>)</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>我僅將此模組移植至 1.21.1 版本，以用於我的整合包&nbsp;<strong>Woven: Steampunkd&nbsp;</strong>（即將推出）。</p>\n<h4><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/978675/description_0c80647f-43e3-48ee-bce9-f81d45f49717.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模組為來自 Create Amorer 的槍械、彈藥與配件添加了<strong>製作與自動化生產</strong>的方式，將其融入沉浸式的 Create 體驗中。</p>\n<p>現在槍械的合成配方更加寫實，且彈藥也能實現大規模生產！</p>\n<p>僅建議使用 Create Armorer 的武器，因為它們最適合搭配 Create 的遊玩流程。</p>\n<h1><strong>全新槍械零件！</strong></h1>\n<p>新增了多項物品，作為製作武器時的過渡步驟。</p>\n<h2><strong>槍管</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_36f3266e-045b-427f-b979-27789e517598.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>扳機機構</strong></h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_103ef41c-451e-4cf0-ad75-f0c28994507b.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><strong>擊發機構</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_ff84806d-929a-43b5-9405-84dcb0881e25.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>全新槍械合成配方！</strong></h1>\n<p>由於 TaCZ 武器相較於一般 Minecraft 與 Create 的武器而言非常強力，因此已透過新增的槍械零件來平衡合成配方。現在您必須準備精密機構與機械加工台等組件才能進行製作。</p>\n<h2><strong>全新「扭矩」左輪手槍配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_d9e08f66-0a87-4cfe-81de-0ff451cf3d78.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>全新「應力」自動手槍配方</strong></h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9131c5d3-5e0a-4eff-bf3e-d089a10aa2fd.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><strong>全新「發條」狙擊步槍配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_83a42696-94d5-4991-a3bf-2bc52727dd26.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>全新「起重」突擊步槍配方</strong></h2>\n<h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_0e078480-ad24-4706-998f-64acab261c06.png\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n<h2><strong>全新「石」霰彈槍配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_af175836-e08d-403c-b556-471bb7139303.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>全新「軸承」霰彈槍配方</strong></h2>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_73c15fe9-1676-415b-83a1-9a8ec64ad949.png\" alt=\"\"></h1>\n<h2><strong>全新「曲柄」衝鋒槍配方</strong></h2>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_27e18b1e-2993-4ed2-8c7a-4ed24b3e4225.png\" alt=\"\"></h1>\n<h2><strong>全新「飛輪」機槍配方</strong></h2>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_7492801b-094b-47fe-98e1-ea6e69243575.png\" alt=\"\"></h1>\n<h2><strong>全新「原子破壞者」近戰武器配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_52ff91f8-5d03-4817-a200-50349df65e5f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2><strong>全新「扳手」近戰武器配方</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_83c10937-0f2c-47a6-a78c-3e8a8ef8b83f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1><strong>全新槍械配件合成配方！</strong></h1>\n<p>一把槍若缺少幾個<strong>配件</strong>就不算完整，因此新增了更多配件的合成配方。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_8f7c5f15-6668-43d2-9d2d-af53cc5b0c14.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_05f62b62-2cbf-4a2f-9c06-ed5fcd8a3c43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_deaa98a9-bd11-4140-911f-2c723c8579c0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_c4a41a2f-a87f-4e65-bf62-c4fe9c21092b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9461e2d1-523b-4aa3-b466-c091d509b820.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_a5c6e183-61d7-484b-9b2f-06a085f49258.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_518867cc-7d22-43f7-b162-417928b8a48a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_e98f9d80-ccf0-4719-8327-e5dfcdd53175.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_c6e654b6-9a8b-45a4-bea6-8acd7d412305.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3aed786c-354a-4f30-ae06-e85cc30e9f44.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_2a34660d-25d7-43a5-9737-4709f7c9b1aa.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_579af3cb-4934-4cb5-bb0a-e1be07933d28.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_032ac40d-838f-41ab-ba46-dbf2a82321c3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_b9f7632e-237f-46ee-825f-067298ed5471.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3836dacd-6c1c-4c6c-9303-6ebede5a360a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_8b60fdca-76c0-4d80-b3bf-527a5b8743bd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1><strong>全新彈殼！</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>彈殼</strong>是透過鋸切黃銅板製成的。您可以使用 JEI 設定過濾器，指定所需的彈殼類型，讓機器自動將其切割成該種樣式。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_3b40259a-2da4-46f3-bbc5-54365fc5c349.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1><strong>全新流體！</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>火藥</strong>現在可以作為流體儲存於槽罐中，並用於各種配方。若您已安裝&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Big Cannons</a>&nbsp;模組，還可以儲存<strong>硝化劑（Nitropowder）</strong>，其在製造底火時比火藥更為高效。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_bf3d69cb-12f3-4976-a02d-aae6558ac1af.png\" alt=\"\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_09c7285c-e7c8-45de-8bfe-8741c552580f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><strong>全新彈藥合成配方！</strong></h1>\n<p>要合成彈藥，需要<strong>底火</strong>。底火是透過將火藥或硝化劑注入安山岩彈殼中製成的。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_9bfa81c9-a5df-42b6-8529-75e6c390987f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_e3120cf5-efc0-4422-ad7d-55e4d655a8f5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>取得底火後，您就可以將其裝入彈殼，並填入火藥來合成您想要的彈藥類型。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1152431/description_07bc5695-766a-47bd-8aa8-f7ca6465a4b2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>製造槍械與生產彈藥都需要用到黃銅，因此在嘗試建立新槍廠前，請確保您已解鎖該技術等級。</p>\n<p>此外，該過程需要消耗大量安山合金，因為每製造一個底火就需要一單位合金，請務必至少將此流程自動化。</p>",
